The packet does not establish a failure order for the whole assembly. The thumbscrews and hooks share loads, but the pack-case insert strength, case geometry, impact pulse, and printed PETG properties are missing. I can quantify weak paths under stated assumptions; I cannot verify that the pack stays captured after a printed part breaks.
